      "text": "ALGEBRAIC CONSTRUCTIONS IN THE CATEGORY OF VECTOR BUNDLES — In this paper we present the category of generalized Lie algebroids.\n\n**ALGEBRAIC CONSTRUCTIONS IN THE CATEGORY OF VECTOR BUNDLES**\n\n*CONSTANTIN M. ARCUS¸*\n\n44 pp, 11 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** In this paper we present the category of generalized Lie algebroids. Important results (a theorem of Maurer-Cartan type, theorems of Cartan type,...) emphasize the importance and the utility of the objects of this new category.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 3.1 The pull-back Lie algebroid of a generaliz; 3.2 Interior Differential Systems; 4.1 Exterior Differential Systems; References; 1 Introduction; 2 The category of generalized Lie algebroids; 3 Interior Differential Systems; 4 Exterior differential calculus; 5 Exterior Differential Systems; 6 Torsion and curvature forms. Identities of C",
